{"parse": {"title": "TRC-03", "pageid": 6340, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/TRC-02\" title=\"TRC-02\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">TRC-03</span><a href=\"/wiki/TRC-04\" title=\"TRC-04\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">TRC</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">03</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E7.8A.AC.E7.B1.BB.E7.9A.84.E5.93.B2.E5.AD.A6\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"犬类的哲学\">犬类的哲学</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 犬类的哲学</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Philosophy of the Puppies</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>书<span class=\"color-value\"></span>籍<span class=\"color-value\"></span>、<span class=\"color-value\"></span>独<span class=\"color-value\"></span>处<span class=\"color-value\"></span>时<span class=\"color-value\"></span>间<span class=\"color-value\"></span>、<span class=\"color-value\"></span>狗<span class=\"color-value\"></span>狗<span class=\"color-value\"></span>香<span class=\"color-value\"></span>波<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>以<span class=\"color-value\"></span>及<span class=\"color-value\"></span>对<span class=\"color-value\"></span>人<span class=\"color-value\"></span>们<span class=\"color-value\"></span>适<span class=\"color-value\"></span>当<span class=\"color-value\"></span>地<span class=\"color-value\"></span>包<span class=\"color-value\"></span>容<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 1110103</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-kanabijie2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"kanabijie2\"><img alt=\"kanabijie2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/Cg-kanabijie2.png/600px-Cg-kanabijie2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/Cg-kanabijie2.png/900px-Cg-kanabijie2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/Cg-kanabijie2.png/1200px-Cg-kanabijie2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>黑白相间的牧羊犬安心地趴在未经修理的花圃里，参差不齐的杂草与野花把他<b>掩藏</b>得很好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>卡纳比街少有如此清闲的时刻。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a5/HeadIconSmall-505001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a5/HeadIconSmall-505001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a5/HeadIconSmall-505001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>阿嚏——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这无疑是短暂的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>汪汪～</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>嗯……汪汪？！<i>&lt;温迪……你是怎么找到这儿来的？！&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在一阵兴奋的叫声之后，小狗们收到了集合的信号，它们从商店里、消防栓旁、马路边结队出现，无一例外地冲向了皮克勒斯的<b>藏身处</b>。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">温迪：</div><div>汪——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪汪，汪汪汪。<i>&lt;我并没有夸赞你的意思……尽管对我们而言，敏锐的嗅觉确实很重要。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪、汪汪。<i>&lt;但我们仍需考虑一些更本质的，一些比嗅觉更重要的东西。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>呜……汪汪？汪？<i>&lt;比如说……我们的存在意味着什么？我们为何生活在这里？&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f7/HeadIconSmall-611301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f7/HeadIconSmall-611301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f7/HeadIconSmall-611301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">温迪：</div><div>呜……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>嗯……汪、汪汪。<i>&lt;为了赢得即将举行的长毛绒绒运动会……当然不是。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>皮克勒斯叹了口气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"612001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-612001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-612001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"612001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-612001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-612001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-612001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-612001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳尔森：</div><div>汪汪汪！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪汪、汪……<i>&lt;重点自然也并非“新增项目是老鼠追捕赛”……&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪汪，汪呜——？<i>&lt;我希望表达的是，这个世界有什么非我们不可的理由吗？&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪，汪汪？<i>&lt;我们是独立的个体，还是仅仅作为某人的宠物而存在？&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/HeadIconSmall-611901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/HeadIconSmall-611901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/HeadIconSmall-611901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">爱丽丝：</div><div>呜……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">温迪：</div><div>汪、汪汪！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>皮克勒斯又叹了一口气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪，汪汪汪、汪汪……<i>&lt;温迪，你是条讨人喜欢的聪明狗狗，人类很乐意把球抛出去，再等你捡回来……&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪，呜呜……？<i>&lt;但如果有一天，你不小心掉进了下水道里呢？&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪、汪汪。<i>&lt;你在赛场上迷路了，被永远地留在了满是老鼠的下水道里。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪汪……<i>&lt;而另一只与温迪一模一样的小狗替代了你……&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪汪，汪……<i>&lt;它有着温迪的记忆与行为，甚至想法也完全一致……&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪、汪呜——？<i>&lt;到了那个时候，温迪还是我们熟悉的那只小狗吗？&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>其他小狗们听得很入神。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">温迪：</div><div>呜——獒！獒！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪、汪汪，汪。<i>&lt;是的，它也擅长找回橡胶弹球，让所有狗为之侧目。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>嗯……汪汪，汪呜？<i>&lt;所以说，我们究竟是基于过往至今的经历与思维而存在，还是别的什么更遥远的东西？&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">温迪：</div><div>呜、呜呜——？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>呜……<i>&lt;对不起。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪汪，汪……嗯。<i>&lt;我不该把你独一无二的找球能力分享给别人……尽管这并不是，好吧，这只是个恐怖故事。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">温迪：</div><div>汪汪——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪。<i>&lt;感谢你的原谅。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这一次，皮克勒斯并没有再叹气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他独自朝着街道的另一端走去，影子被阳光拉得很长。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/HeadIconSmall-611901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/HeadIconSmall-611901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/HeadIconSmall-611901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">爱丽丝：</div><div>呜——？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/HeadIconSmall-306301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/HeadIconSmall-306301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/HeadIconSmall-306301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>吽，吽吽。<i>&lt;别担心，我只是想搞点馅料满满的苹果派。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/HeadIconSmall-306301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/HeadIconSmall-306301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/HeadIconSmall-306301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪汪。<i>&lt;也祝愿你们比赛顺利。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-shezhengjie.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"shezhengjie\"><img alt=\"shezhengjie\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/Cg-shezhengjie.png/600px-Cg-shezhengjie.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/Cg-shezhengjie.png/900px-Cg-shezhengjie.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/Cg-shezhengjie.png/1200px-Cg-shezhengjie.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>皮克勒斯小心翼翼地避开人群，他终于找到了一个难得的安静树荫。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>狺狺。<i>&lt;或许寻求理解本身就是一种谬误。犬与人无法真正地相互理解，甚至与其他犬们也不能。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>狺、狺狺。<i>&lt;我应该考虑换一种生活，也许远方会有真正能够理解我的朋友。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>狺——？<i>&lt;那么，我做好了离开的准备了吗？&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>皮克勒斯抬头望天。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>现在仍是三月，樱树上却意外地结出了苹果。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-302801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-302801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-302801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>机车酒吧正门位于北环路，与终点的距离约为4.803英里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-302801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-302801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-302801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>星锑船长的时速为65英里，但考虑到比赛的要求，抵达这儿只需要更短的时间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"560101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-560101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-560101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"560101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-560101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-560101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-560101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-560101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪……汪？！<i>&lt;一颗过早成熟的、会说话的苹果……&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"560101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-560101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-560101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"560101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-560101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-560101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-560101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-560101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪汪汪……<i>&lt;我没有嗅过什么奇怪的东西，不应该看到幻觉……&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"560101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-560101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-560101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"560101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-560101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-560101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-560101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-560101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>狺……<i>&lt;我想我真的饿昏头了……&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>嗯？这儿有一只可爱的小狗。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>苹果先生缓缓从高空中降落下来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>你好，小狗先生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>吽，吽吽。<i>&lt;噢，这不是幻觉。你的气味告诉我……你也是一位神秘学家。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪。<i>&lt;您好，苹果先生。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪，汪汪。<i>&lt;这是我第一次遇见其他的，不那么像人类的神秘学家。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪汪，汪汪汪。<i>&lt;我原以为只有我是如此的异类，理所当然地孤立在人群之外。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>你看上去有些激动，小狗先生……你饿了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>我想……我下落得不是时候。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪汪。<i>&lt;不，您来得正是时候。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪汪汪。<i>&lt;我有很多关于神秘学家的问题需要向您求证。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>请不要随便露出舌头，这会让APPLe某压力倍增。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>船长，救我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>嗯……汪汪？<i>&lt;您在呼喊另一位朋友？您还认识其他的神秘学家吗？&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪汪、汪？<i>&lt;他也与您形态相仿？就像另一颗智慧的苹果？&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>皮克勒斯的眼神里写满了期待。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>当我提到船长的名字时，你似乎兴致满满。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>如果星锑船长能够顺利结束比赛，我或许能为你们互相引荐……现在，让我们拉开距离，小狗儿……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>狺狺。<i>&lt;听上去是一个特别的名字。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>哦？看起来你对“星锑船长”很感兴趣？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>她是一位流浪在自由广阔的公海之上，所有强权者和老古董都抓不住的伟大海盗。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>这个说法足够确切吗？希望我的用词能够达到船长要求的标准。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪？汪汪？！<i>&lt;她的身份是海盗吗？而不是另一位身为苹果的神秘学家？&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪汪……呜。<i>&lt;但听起来您能和她互相理解……我很好奇其中的缘由。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>我猜你会喜欢星锑船长的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪，汪汪……<i>&lt;我很羡慕您……不必被迫接受低级的、乏味的爱好，更不需要考虑如何躲避类似枕头大战、抛球比赛之类的邀请。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>吽——！吽吽。<i>&lt;您是如何解决的？尤其是当您的人类同伴完全无法理解您时。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>我们大多时候都在伦敦的各处流浪，船长热衷于一切新奇的、有趣的事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>狺……狺狺。<i>&lt;流浪……听上去是一个不错的选择。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪汪、汪。<i>&lt;我会慎重考虑您的提议……谢谢您，苹果先生。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>街上的不远处传来了引擎的轰鸣声，剧烈的碰撞声，以及少女的呼喊声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>很抱歉，小狗，但我得走了，星锑船长似乎遇到了麻烦。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>很高兴能与你聊天。希望下次见面时，我能完全理解你的意思。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>或许我能做出点儿小东西来帮助我们相互交流……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>再见，小狗。汪汪汪～</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪？<i>&lt;嗯?&gt;</i></div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "TRC-03"}}